WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Check audio availability
Inspect microphone and speaker capabilities. Start with a saved audio sample or a quiet, controlled input; keep output volume low.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
One owner at a time
Stop audio before switching to another audio function. FM needs separate hardware; a DSP unit test is not a physical sound-path test.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Enter Remote deliberately
Stop other operations before starting Remote. Wait for confirmed mode change. The app must show a failure if entry is not acknowledged.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Return to companion
Stop Remote, wait for reconnection and request device information again. Test disconnect and rotation separately; record failures with versions.
